{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00649","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 雍和二章 二 · 张说","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 雍和二章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"俎豆有馥，粢盛絜丰。\n亦有和羹，既戒既平。\n鼓钟管磬，肃唱和鸣。\n皇皇后祖，来我思成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}